The vecten skills are vendored here by `vecten init` from the installed vecten package, one
`<name>/SKILL.md` per skill, and re-vendored by `vecten update` once it exists (phase 9). Start
with `guide/SKILL.md`; `vecten guide` prints the same text.
[% if 'platform' in components %]The project's `.mcp.json` is written alongside them.
[% endif %]
